79100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"buREH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e2bfcfd4-3760-463e-8854-830a49a09149","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"これ、Cとかじゃ全く太刀打ちできない気がするけどどうなんでしょ","ts":"1618640671.378600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T+E"}]},{"client_msg_id":"61299b53-ff1c-43fe-943f-686073f34a7d","type":"message","user":"UBQ2H65JQ","text":"オブジェクト指向的にカプセル化や抽象化をきれいにすると、読みやすくはなるけど、コード変更しにくくなって、表裏一体ですよね","ts":"1618640567.378200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DLx92"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be17d7e5-59b7-4b3e-aa03-39ba92608fce","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"まぁ関数名とかを読んで、詳細な関数内の実装を極力読まないみたいなことなんだろうけど","ts":"1618640517.377300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"RvS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f66fb82b-6ccf-49c7-a126-b719346062e6","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"あとは、オブジェクト指向言語限定な気がしなくもない","ts":"1618640469.376100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Gvn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bb12b56e-0681-4d84-956c-ea66bca521c6","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"逆に言うと「ちゃんと整備すべき」というのはこれなんですよね","ts":"1618640469.376000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"tashikani","count":2,"users":["U01AQ5BFNLX","UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"l7sh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3f36510c-e104-44f4-b345-97b93e7fa26d","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"そうですよね…Javadocとかあるけどこれもちゃんと整備されている前提だからどうなんだろって感じ","ts":"1618640443.375200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qG2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"501476ce-a139-4717-a65e-e96b80817766","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"インターフェイスがきれいじゃないコードだと破滅するんだよなあ…","ts":"1618640391.374300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":2,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U8R597E9H"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"N4Os"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df94016b-fa90-4deb-9d28-8792654a6b3b","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"なるほどなぁ\n\u003chttps://note.com/simplearchitect/n/n8cd219056536\u003e","ts":"1618640353.373900","attachments":[{"fallback":"note（ノート）: コードリーディングのコツは極力コードを読まないこと｜牛尾　剛｜note","id":1,"title":"コードリーディングのコツは極力コードを読まないこと｜牛尾　剛｜note","title_link":"https://note.com/simplearchitect/n/n8cd219056536","text":"私はクラウドのプロダクトチームで働いているが、何を隠そう一番苦手で克服できていないことが、コードリーディングだ。ものすごーく時間かかるし、時間かかったうえに読み間違えたりするし、しかもめっちゃ頭使うのに他の人はずっと速いので敗北感しか残らない。先日もマネージャの Pragna に相談したら、最初は２時間かかるけど、３か月もしたら５分で終わるわよ。って言われたけど、いや、そもそも俺４時間は最低かかるねんけどな、、、って感じ。 技術イケメンの皆さんのアドバイス 　よくよく私のキャリアを考えると、OSSにコントリビュートとかしていることはあったが、めっちゃくちゃ巨大でややこしいコードベ","image_url":"https://assets.st-note.com/production/uploads/images/50165781/rectangle_large_type_2_4e2131889c4ecbe4b9f26638c813b69f.png?fit=bounds\u0026quality=85\u0026width=1280","blocks":null,"service_name":"note（ノート）","service_icon":"https://d291vdycu0ht11.cloudfront.net/nuxt/static/metaicon/apple-touch-icon.png","from_url":"https://note.com/simplearchitect/n/n8cd219056536","original_url":"https://note.com/simplearchitect/n/n8cd219056536"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"IQQXD"}]}]
